    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/3f844dc147f982881f07fe933e910f9c.poster.avif?t=1750810211\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/3f844dc147f982881f07fe933e910f9c.webm?t=1750810211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/3f844dc147f982881f07fe933e910f9c.mp4?t=1750810211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Experience the action-packed story of Circuit Thunder\u00ae. Circuit Thunder\u00ae is a 2D-platformer, action-adventure RPG where you follow the legendary Electrex Bolt\u00ae and master electrifying abilities of light, ultimately harnessing lightning as your weapon. Traverse through novel lands, battle mysterious enemies, and strategically learn new defensive and offensive abilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Begin your journey with the first book, <strong>Circuit Thunder\u00ae: Hypcampex\u00ae</strong></i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOOK I : HYPCAMPEX\u00ae</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/314ae9bbc0a29f0302006e6f0ff6a2ce.avif?t=1750810211\" data-has-big width=800 height=1200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set within Planet Photonus, you will embark on a journey as the legendary Electrex Bolt\u00ae to acquire the artifact of the Hypcampex\u00ae and stop the Avengers of Light, the Lavengers, from destroying the planet. With vibrant environments, pestering enemies, and innovative maps, you will be able to put your skills to the test and brave the war against the Lavengers. Will Electrex Bolt\u00ae succeed?\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/f0f2f90008dfe90d9012debcabab8883.avif?t=1750810211\" width=600 height=250 /></span><strong>SAVE PLANET PHOTONUS FROM ANARCHY </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the drone waves deployed by the Lavengers and best their tactics. The trials and puzzles that lie ahead will not be easy feats. It will take the most omnipotent of prowess. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/0c69f39ed909ee8f45b9006d895f1102.avif?t=1750810211\" width=600 height=250 /></span><strong>FIGHT THROUGH SPACE </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through space on the BOLT Voyager V3 and show the Lavengers that Electrex Bolt\u00ae is the best pilot within the galaxy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/3c12ae65f86a2c2838c975ec7d6a2a9d.poster.avif?t=1750810211\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/3c12ae65f86a2c2838c975ec7d6a2a9d.webm?t=1750810211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/3c12ae65f86a2c2838c975ec7d6a2a9d.mp4?t=1750810211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>MASTER THE LIGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does Electrex Bolt\u00ae have what it takes to master the light and revive those whom he has lost? </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/3f844dc147f982881f07fe933e910f9c.poster.avif?t=1750810211\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/3f844dc147f982881f07fe933e910f9c.webm?t=1750810211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/3f844dc147f982881f07fe933e910f9c.mp4?t=1750810211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Experience the action-packed story of Circuit Thunder\u00ae. Circuit Thunder\u00ae is a 2D-platformer, action-adventure RPG where you follow the legendary Electrex Bolt\u00ae and master electrifying abilities of light, ultimately harnessing lightning as your weapon. Traverse through novel lands, battle mysterious enemies, and strategically learn new defensive and offensive abilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Begin your journey with the first book, <strong>Circuit Thunder\u00ae: Hypcampex\u00ae</strong></i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOOK I : HYPCAMPEX\u00ae</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/314ae9bbc0a29f0302006e6f0ff6a2ce.avif?t=1750810211\" data-has-big width=800 height=1200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set within Planet Photonus, you will embark on a journey as the legendary Electrex Bolt\u00ae to acquire the artifact of the Hypcampex\u00ae and stop the Avengers of Light, the Lavengers, from destroying the planet. With vibrant environments, pestering enemies, and innovative maps, you will be able to put your skills to the test and brave the war against the Lavengers. Will Electrex Bolt\u00ae succeed?\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/f0f2f90008dfe90d9012debcabab8883.avif?t=1750810211\" width=600 height=250 /></span><strong>SAVE PLANET PHOTONUS FROM ANARCHY </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the drone waves deployed by the Lavengers and best their tactics. The trials and puzzles that lie ahead will not be easy feats. It will take the most omnipotent of prowess. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/0c69f39ed909ee8f45b9006d895f1102.avif?t=1750810211\" width=600 height=250 /></span><strong>FIGHT THROUGH SPACE </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through space on the BOLT Voyager V3 and show the Lavengers that Electrex Bolt\u00ae is the best pilot within the galaxy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/3c12ae65f86a2c2838c975ec7d6a2a9d.poster.avif?t=1750810211\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/3c12ae65f86a2c2838c975ec7d6a2a9d.webm?t=1750810211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814260/extras/3c12ae65f86a2c2838c975ec7d6a2a9d.mp4?t=1750810211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>MASTER THE LIGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does Electrex Bolt\u00ae have what it takes to master the light and revive those whom he has lost? </p>",
